<description>&lt;p&gt;US officials are weighing a military training and demining mission for Syrian forces, while a budget shortfall threatens the chemical weapons watchdog’s ability to continue work in Syria. Israeli forces raided southern Syria, wounding Syrian soldiers, and a drone strike in western Sweida injured four Syrian internal security personnel. In Damascus countryside, two Christian young men were found dead, and in Homs a church robbery led to the arrest of suspects, including a guard. A son of a Daesh leader was killed in Homs. 2,732 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikAFBVV95cUxNd2tMTDZEYUhaR0lYVlhOTVpicEV6a3VJN2RSV1pVdXMxRmJwQkFUd1hzNWZEa0pSUkJaQ0l6SVNjM1pfMllVR2hNV2FNb2FZUTNuclJzLTdkenNHU3RncUJKUzRKcWswcTJkRkRQZjBuU0h3dDJBdlV0V25nU2xpQlA5UWFnMkZSZnlFMXRsbmQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxQYTJtZmx1VXI2Q3cyVDR1VlhSUFI2WV9LMnhPdTFma0swdm4xd0pzZEdranA0VnlYTEV5TFNrX05zd1Q3RU9jLVZNcTRaT1g1ZXV4OVE2aVNKOHd1MGE3UHQzZWthcWVPanc3MEFUTDMzclFwTnVGU0tvVVVrbS04R1NnUzVDaDRnS1BPa3B6aHIwenMyZHVTb282U0FHVmhLQ2hPT1JDTmM5d3hXZG1NSDRLckpvNmFx0gG-AUFVX3lxTE83QjBNWEN2WXFXOW9VOTRZUFJZZUZWTVRzaUxqdEhJcHJibU04alNrTUptWDJMSDNzNERHYVNoLXJHc2dKZXpucGY0dXBobF9uYk14QnBEOVFhVkZFUTZzQkJXTlZISlV0WHBRQUhKYkZkdWlsYkVOT1F4dkcwSnhKSmlPc3dxemxBU2t5U1puM2NyUlBROXBWY2tiN3RBZEZFaWFFUzQwSEQ1eHAtYlhxcEN0ZGZSbWVUbjFHNUE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuwFBVV95cUxQSlAzUnAzUGpEMEFyTXI0VWFBQk5zX1U3cjVqemRCVGFTNGNoTnpjTG94X3pfUzFVQUxIU0hlWjVhN2lLZzFBNk1nWHZxclhRVmZTcmtqTmt6REt4QkR2enoydTIyUENHU21UOEVBZWRVeUx2QVFXaUdhNzdmS3FyREVmemFJWEVscmJxbHVmLVp3QVVvdTdqYjltc1